                                "sense_id": "3c5229e9-447c-39b6-8292-327375fe1f8d",
                                "text": "My few senses long ago revealed to me their imperfections and deceptivity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f7b5215-709b-4f45-a22f-d5e041c59ba8",
                                "sense_id": "3c5229e9-447c-39b6-8292-327375fe1f8d",
                                "text": "Company-wide totals take on an iceberg-like deceptivity—what isn’t shown may be more important than what is."
                            }
                        ]
