                                "sense_id": "f971b847-278b-3e0b-8880-1d7199c5e34b",
                                "text": "Alas, if he look to the Seen Powers only, he may as well quit the business; his No-thing will never rightly issue as a Thing, but as a Deceptivity, a Sham-thing, — which it had better not do!"
                            }
